        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010#2\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010#2.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 103,
        "raw": "[name=\"大鲍勃\"]   至少我们之间的问题是可以解决的，格拉尼！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "大鲍勃",
        "content": "至少我们之间的问题是可以解决的，格拉尼！"
    },
    {
